    skos:definition "Deaths from any cause were identified and confirmed for the cohort using multiple concurrent approaches including follow-up interviews, written annual questionnaires or telephone contacts with study participants or next-of-kin, surveillance of local hospital records and community obituaries, and linkage with the Social Security Administration Death Master File. (For more information, see [Punjabi et al. 2009 (PMID: 19688045)](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19688045)) (source: SHHS data dictionary)"@en ;
